      "source_number": "731",
      "independent_solution": "a-k give 7,3,26,-14,45,20,2,60,3/4,1/2,2/3. In order: sqrt(7)^2=7; sqrt(3)*sqrt(3)=3; (-sqrt(26))^2=26; -sqrt(14)*sqrt(14)=-14; (3sqrt(5))^2=9*5=45; 10sqrt(2)*sqrt(2)=10*2=20; (0.5sqrt(8))^2=0.25*8=2; (-2sqrt(15))^2=4*15=60; (sqrt(3)/2)^2=3/4; (sqrt(3)/sqrt(6))^2=3/6=1/2; (-sqrt(2)/sqrt(3))^2=2/3. All numeric denominators are nonzero positive. The coefficient 10 is outside any overall square.",
