      }
    },
    {
      "source_number": "736",
      "independent_solution": "In USD/kg, let rice r and wheat w satisfy 2r+3w=2.66 and r-w=0.58. With r=w+0.58, 5w+1.16=2.66, so w=1.50/5=0.30 and r=0.88. Check 2*0.88+3*0.30=1.76+0.90=2.66 and 0.88-0.30=0.58. Prices are positive, 88 and 30 cents per kg. Dollars/cents preserve the given 2.66 total and 0.58 premium without exchange-rate conversion.",
      "coverage": {
